{title: O God Our Help in Ages Past}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{columns: 2}

{start_of_verse: 1}
O [C]God, our [G]help in [F]ages [C]past
Our [Am]hope for [D]years to [G]come[**]
Our [C]shelter [G]from the [Am]stormy [E7]blast
And [F]our e[G]ternal [C]home[**];
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Un[C]der the [G]shadow [F]of your [C]throne
Your [Am]saints have [D]dwelt se[G]cure[**]
Su[C]fficient [G]is your [Am]arm a[E7]lone
And [F]our de[G]fense is [C]sure[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Be[C]fore the [G]hills in [F]order [C]stood
Or [Am]earth re[D]ceived its [G]frame[**]
From [C]ever[G]lasting [Am]you are [E7]God
To [F]endless [G]years the [C]same[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
A [C]thousand [G]ages [F]in your [C]sight
Are [Am]like an [D]evening [G]gone[**]
Short [C]as the [G]watch that [Am]ends the [E7]night
Be[F]fore the [G]rising [C]sun[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
Time, [C]like an [G]ever-[F]rolling [C]stream
Soon [Am]bears us [D]all a[G]way[**]
We [C]fly for[G]gotten, [Am]as a [E7]dream
Dies [F]at the [G]op'ning [C]day[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 6}
O [C]God, our [G]help in [F]ages [C]past
Our [Am]hope for [D]years to [G]come[**]
Still [C]be our [G]guard while [Am]troubles [E7]last
And [F]our e[G]ternal [C]home[**].
{end_of_verse}
